  "note": "Mihara: Bonding Chain \u2014 MG/Fire. Board: 1.076 HOT on 2 graded comps (1.03 / 1.12). Restraint dump gated to her own Full Burst end; S2 Ensnaring generation does NOT consume Restraint (2026-08-21). Ensnaring Chains is modeled as a LIVE stack pool. Kit-faithfulness is pinned test-first in scripts/tests/units/mihara-bonding-chain.test.ts (16 tests, groups M1-M5).\nRESTRAINT CHAINS: a live resource `restraint` [0..10], initial 10, recharged to 10 at the end of her own Full Burst, and consumed at 0.4s per stack over 4s. Each consumption deals 50.06% damage and adds +1 Ensnaring stack.\nS2 STACK GENERATION: after 40 normal attacks during Full Burst on an Ensnared target, Ensnaring stacks \u25b2 1. This does NOT consume Restraint and does NOT deal the 50.06% dump damage.\nBURST: Dragging Chain is modeled as a live SNAPSHOT of Ensnaring stacks into a `mirror` resource at cast, then Ensnaring is cancelled; the DoT ticks read mirror \u00d7 50.05 for 10s (1001%/s when mirror is 20).",
